'''Super Lust''' is a [[mini-boss]] and one of the [[Seven Deadly Sins#Super Sins|Seven Super Deadly Sins]]. She is randomly encountered as an alternate version of {{e|Lust}}.

== Behavior ==
* Super Lust chases Isaac around the room at a very fast speed, leaving a trail of damaging [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]] behind and attempting to do contact damage.
** She builds up speed the longer she travels without turning and takes heavily reduced knockback from Isaac's tears.
Super Lust deals a whole heart of contact damage.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr}} Super Lust can drop {{i|Yum Heart}} even if Isaac has already encountered/possessed it. 
* A high [[speed]] attribute and/or [[flight]] helps with the fight tremendously.

== Trivia ==
* The [[wikipedia:Seven Deadly Sins|Seven Deadly Sins]] that these mini-bosses are based upon are, in Christian teachings, a classification of vices from which all others are derived.
* Super Lust appears to be violently diseased or sick, which could be a reference to [[wikipedia:Sexually transmitted disease|sexually transmitted diseases]] (STDs), which fits Super Lust's sin. Super Lust's maimed appearance could also imply rough or violent sexual acts, which is an extreme act of lust.
* Super Lust is female, like her counterpart {{e|Lust}}.

